    506  5da2							; SHIFT + /: roll the patch. Each effect the dice use (efDice) goes on with
    507  5da2							; its chance, its settings anywhere in their dice ranges; or off. The tone,
    508  5da2							; envelope, levels and octaves stay. The name gets a *. C= + / undoes it.
    509  5da2				   DiceRoll
    510  5da2					      subroutine
